                                "sense_id": "10b5df50-9df0-3fb4-80a7-4ef5499ca6e6",
                                "text": "Despite relying on water alone to grow plants, hydroponics systems require 90 percent less water than crops grown in soil, due to water recycling and the self-contained nature of the system. Because of the closed nature of the system, it is […]"
